# Wails build artefacts.
#
# frontend/dist is not kept as a tracked placeholder: main.go's
# //go:embed all:frontend/dist is behind `//go:build desktop`, so an untagged
# `go build ./...` never sees it, and `wails build` compiles the frontend
# before the Go code, dist always exists by the time the embed is evaluated.
build/bin/
frontend/dist/
frontend/node_modules/
# Generated by `wails build` / `wails dev`.
frontend/wailsjs/
# Wails' "did package.json change" install cache marker.
frontend/package.json.md5
